  "body": "Positioned in one of the Peninsula's most sought-after streets, this beautifully presented four-bedroom home offers the perfect blend of privacy, lifestyle and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for those who value both comfort and freedom, the home is tucked away from the street, creating a peaceful and private sanctuary from the moment you arrive. \r\n\r\nSun-soaked courtyards and expansive north-facing decking flow seamlessly from both the upper and lower levels, providing multiple outdoor spaces to relax, entertain and enjoy the stunning surroundings.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spacious modern kitchen, well-appointed for everyday living and entertaining alike. The open-plan dining and living areas connect effortlessly to the outdoor spaces and are perfectly positioned to capture the breathtaking panoramic sea views.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a professional couple, growing family, or downsizer seeking a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, this home delivers the flexibility and ease to make the most of your leisure time. Simply lock up, head away, and return to your own private retreat.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a home that combines location, privacy, effortless living and spectacular sea views. \r\n\r\nDon't miss out, contact us today to schedule a private viewing if you are unable to make our open homes.",
